  "body": "If space, sunshine and easy family living are high on your wish list, this five-bedroom, three-bathroom home is a must see.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the modern kitchen, dining and lounge flow seamlessly onto a large, sun-drenched north-facing deck, creating the perfect setting for summer entertaining, relaxed family dinners or simply enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nThe well-considered layout offers plenty of flexibility for families. On the main level, a bedroom and bathroom provide an ideal option for guests, teenagers, extended family or working from home, while the spacious internal access garage offers excellent everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find a generous master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, a further three bedrooms and a family bathroom, providing plenty of room for growing families.\r\n\r\nOutside, the easy-care landscaping keeps maintenance to a minimum, leaving more time to enjoy everything this fantastic location has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe position is a real highlight, with local schools, parks, Narrow Neck Beach, public transport and a range of sports facilities all close by. Devonport village is just a short drive away, with its fantastic selection of cafés, shops and restaurants, while both Devonport and Bayswater provide convenient ferry connections to the CBD.\r\n\r\nFor added peace of mind, a building report is available for interested buyers.\r\n\r\nSpacious, practical and made for entertaining, this is easy family living in a location that’s hard to beat.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today to arrange your viewing!",
